cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "dietzia-tr-pipeline: tandem-repeat discovery and coding-sequence length-difference classification in Dietzia"
abstract: >-
  Two linked pipelines. The first discovers variable-number tandem-repeat loci
  in bacterial genomes and selects a discriminatory MLVA panel. The second
  pairs orthologous coding sequences between a reference genome and its
  nearest neighbours and assigns every length difference to a mechanism:
  tandem-repeat copy-number change, alternative start or stop codon,
  insertion-sequence activity, internal duplication, or an unresolved residual.
authors:
